What happened?

92
00:05:53,363 --> 00:05:56,224
Pending, no node assigned.

93
00:05:57,967 --> 00:06:00,643
Two fixes, for two situations.

94
00:06:00,643 --> 00:06:05,461
If the Pod belongs on that node, give it a toleration:

95
00:06:07,200 --> 00:06:07,913
Got it.

96
00:06:07,913 --> 00:06:10,664
What do I need to remember?

97
00:06:11,200 --> 00:06:18,144
The scheduler filters nodes by free requests, nodeSelector labels and taints, then picks one.

98
00:06:18,700 --> 00:06:25,109
nodeSelector pulls a Pod to labelled nodes; a taint pushes Pods away unless they tolerate it.

99
00:06:25,667 --> 00:06:29,566
